  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RADIO EDUCATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Radio Sicuani use their radio station as a means to educate the community about their human rights and to encourage people to pressure the government to deliver basic services and respect human rights. It acts as a space for youth and women to express themselves and seeks to contribute to the construction of networks promoting peace and justice. In addition Radio Sicuani aims to teach people about the church and promotes Christian values.</narrative>
  </description>
